\caption{Few-NERD INTRA coarse selection and quality estimation (Qwen3-8B, $N{=}8$, $T{=}1.0$). LP achieves significant selection gains; all structural signals degrade. Global $\rho$ reflects full-set correlation; Cond.\ $\rho$ restricts to non-zero F1 instances ($n{=}31{,}094$). CI: bootstrap 95\% interval for selection $\Delta$.}
\label{tab:fewnerd}
